headers {
  X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
}

docs {
  Requests against the Tyyni API. Pick the Local or Vercel environment; on Vercel, set the
  secret `apiKey` (the API project's `API_KEY`) in the environment first.

  Run "Create user" once, or set `userId` in the environment to an existing user. "Simulate"
  then fills that user's data and stores the first suggestion's id for "Suggestion feedback".
}
